  "content": {
    "visible_text": "Skip to Content About Schedule Youth Program FAQs Contact < back Head Muay Thai Coach Dave Competition Experience: Top-ranked amateur competitor in California's 127-130lb weight class (2013-2015) Coaching Experience: Youngest apprentice instructor under Ajarn Chai Sirisute, Thai Boxing Association of America (2009) 15+ years coaching at the top California and East Coast Muay Thai academies Registered IKF cornerman for amateur and professional competitors WBC registered coach for Team USA 3x Gold Medalist in WBC International Tournaments 2x Gold Medalist in WKA International Tournament (Wales, UK) Dave has over 20 years in martial arts, and he is dedicated to being a welcoming, knowledgeable, and informative instructor. His teaching career spans 15 years across Pennsylvania, New Jersey, and California, focusing on youth and adult classes, as well as personal training. Dave's hope is to make his students feel comfortable and competent, both in martial arts and in life. He has established successful programs at reputable schools like Rise Combat Sports in San Francisco and Round 5 Martial Arts Academy in San Leandro. Available for Private Coaching Name First Name (required) Last Name (required) Phone Email (required) Message (required) Submit Schedule About Newsletter Pricing FAQ s hello@cmasf.com I ‍  ‍ (415) 359-9294 ‍   ‍ 1217 Polk,  San Francisco",
